{"id":12326,"date":"2024-11-01T11:23:28","date_gmt":"2024-11-01T11:23:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12326"},"modified":"2024-11-01T11:23:28","modified_gmt":"2024-11-01T11:23:28","slug":"picoraman-m3-jako-procesni-analyzator-perfuznich-kultur","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/picoraman-m3-jako-procesni-analyzator-perfuznich-kultur\/","title":{"rendered":"PicoRaman M3 jako procesn\u00ed analyz\u00e1tor perfuzn\u00edch kultur"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je v\u00fdjime\u010dn\u00e1 i d\u00edky sv\u00e9 v\u0161estrannosti, d\u00edky \u010demu\u017e se ka\u017ed\u00fd den objev\u00ed jej\u00ed dal\u0161\u00ed a dal\u0161\u00ed aplikace. Nap\u0159\u00edklad ve sv\u00e9 magistersk\u00e9 pr\u00e1ci na Kungliga Tekniska h\u00f6gskolan (KTH) pou\u017eila Fernanda Rebellato Giordano Martim spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/picoraman-m3\/\"><strong>PicoRaman M3<\/strong><\/a> s technologi\u00ed <strong>Timegated\u00ae Raman<\/strong> ke studiu mo\u017enosti nasazen\u00ed PAT n\u00e1stroj\u016f (Process Analytical Technologies) v perfuzn\u00edch kultur\u00e1ch. C\u00edlem bylo zjistit, jak mohou PAT n\u00e1stroje pomoci automaticky \u0159\u00eddit kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 parametry procesu (CPP) a udr\u017eet kvalitu v\u00fdroby v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase, co\u017e je z\u00e1sadn\u00ed pro modern\u00ed biotechnologii a farmaceutickou v\u00fdrobu.<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Co studie zjistila<\/span>:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u0158\u00edzen\u00ed kvality za b\u011bhu<\/strong>: Pomoc\u00ed Timegated Raman technologie m\u016f\u017ee PicoRaman M3 z\u00edsk\u00e1vat data, kter\u00e1 lze vyu\u017e\u00edt k predikci kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch parametr\u016f kultivace v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase. T\u00edm se zaji\u0161\u0165uje st\u00e1l\u00e1 kvalita procesu a sn\u00ed\u017een\u00ed rizika chyb ve v\u00fdrob\u011b.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Aplikace p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b monoklon\u00e1ln\u00edch protil\u00e1tek (mAb)<\/strong>: Tradi\u010dn\u011b se mAb vyr\u00e1b\u00ed d\u00e1vkov\u011b, co\u017e \u010dasto vede ke ztr\u00e1t\u00e1m kv\u016fli omezen\u00e9 kontrole kvality. Perfuzn\u00ed kultury umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdnosy (a\u017e 130 g\/L oproti b\u011b\u017en\u00fdm 5-10 g\/L), a tak\u00e9 flexibiln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdrobn\u00ed podm\u00ednky a mo\u017enost testov\u00e1n\u00ed v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Siln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed prediktivn\u00ed modely<\/strong>: Studie potvrdila, \u017ee v\u011bt\u0161\u00ed objem dat znamen\u00e1 robustn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed predikci. Multivaria\u010dn\u00ed modely na b\u00e1zi Ramanovy technologie tak dok\u00e1\u017eou p\u0159edpov\u00eddat r\u016fzn\u00e9 kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 parametry sou\u010dasn\u011b, \u010d\u00edm\u017e zvy\u0161uj\u00ed p\u0159esnost monitoringu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Pro\u010d je to d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9?<\/strong> D\u00edky rostouc\u00ed popt\u00e1vce po mAb l\u00e9c\u00edch pro l\u00e9\u010dbu rakoviny a autoimunitn\u00edch chorob je nutn\u00e9 zvy\u0161ovat efektivitu v\u00fdroby. PAT n\u00e1stroje, jako je PicoRaman M3, otev\u00edraj\u00ed nov\u00e9 mo\u017enosti v \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed kvality a efektivit\u011b proces\u016f, co\u017e je pro modern\u00ed farmaceutick\u00e9 firmy neoceniteln\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Pro v\u00edce informac\u00ed si st\u00e1hn\u011bte <a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/products-and-services\/products\/picoraman-m3\"><strong>bro\u017euru k p\u0159\u00edstroji<\/strong><\/a> a pod\u00edvejte se, jak technologie Timegated Raman pom\u00e1h\u00e1 m\u011bnit biotechnologickou v\u00fdrobu, a v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b dotaz\u016f n\u00e1s nev\u00e1hejte <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/o-nas\/\">kontaktovat<\/a>.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12008\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12008\" style=\"width: 550px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpr